# Local Claude Code settings. Carries the machine's gateway env — including a
# live ANTHROPIC_API_KEY — so it is deliberately not shared. Untracked as of
# 2026-08-04; the only thing the repo lost with it was
# `worktree.bgIsolation: "none"`, which a fresh clone now has to set itself.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# Driver captures (#146). These were tracked, and a single `npm run test:dom`
# rewrote them, so a real change got lost in a diff full of regenerated PNGs.
# They were never a reference anybody compared against: #142 and #148 establish
# two independent sources of run-to-run drift, and a capture nobody can diff is
# not a baseline. The captures a critic actually grades come from `inspect.mjs`
# into `SCREENSHOT_DIR`, and the drivers' own assertions carry the guarantee.
#
# Deliberately narrow, not `scripts/**/*.png`. `scripts/spike-117-shots/` is
# cited by path in `spike-117-findings.json` and `spike-117-findings.md` as the
# evidence behind a recorded finding, and a broad rule would conceal it.
scripts/gui-*-shots/
